msgid "`react-test-renderer`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/react-test-renderer_README.md:3
msgid ""
"This package provides an experimental React renderer that can be used to "
"render React components to pure JavaScript objects, without depending on "
"the DOM or a native mobile environment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/react-test-renderer_README.md:5
msgid ""
"Essentially, this package makes it easy to grab a snapshot of the \"DOM "
"tree\" rendered by a React DOM or React Native component without using a "
"browser or jsdom."
msgstr ""

